#!/bin/sh
# yabi demo: printed once the application took over from the splash
[ "$1" = start ] || exit 0
cat <<'MSG'

  Boot complete: the splash handed the screen over to the demo application.
  To play with yabi, in this console:

    killall fbv           stop the demo application
    yabi start theme2     show a splash
    yabi progress 30      move the progress bar
    yabi theme default    switch theme on the fly
    yabi pause / resume   stop and restart the animation
    yabi status           frame, frame count, pause state
    yabi quit             close the splash

  Quit QEMU with Ctrl-a x.

MSG
